    11	/// Employee-facing, so the scoping is the important part: it shows the settlement belonging to
    12	/// <c>Session["EmpID"]</c> and nothing else. The same rule the Home calendar and My Tasks use.
    13	///
    14	/// Wording matters more here than on any other screen in the module — this is the one page an
