1198	    /// Settles the loan schedule this settlement recovered.
1199	    ///
1200	    /// Every unpaid installment is marked paid, not just the settlement month's, because
1201	    /// the settlement recovered the WHOLE outstanding. Leaving them unpaid would inflate
1202	    /// the loan's outstanding for ever, since outstanding is derived as SUM(EMIAmount)
1203	    /// over unpaid rows.
