/// HR_EmployeeMaster, HR_EmployeeBasicSalary, HR_MonthlyAttendance, HR_PayrollSalaryConfirmation,
/// HR_EmployeeWiseLeave, HR_EmployeeWiseSalaryHead and HR_SalaryAdditionalHead (cross-checked
/// against their EF entities/Fluent mappings even though this repository is Dapper, not EF).
